  >>> tf.sparse.expand_dims(sp, axis=0).shape.as_list()
  [1, 10, 10, 3]

  The new axis location matches Python `list.insert(axis, 1)`:

  >>> tf.sparse.expand_dims(sp, axis=1).shape.as_list()
